    cml:logicSummary "Mandatory duty" ;
    cml:premiseText "(a) an FWC Member is dealing with a matter (other than by forming part of a Full Bench or an Expert Panel in relation to a matter); and (b) the FWC Member becomes unavailable to continue dealing with the matter before the matter is completely dealt with." ;
