concept:prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009-sec-794a-ss-4 cml:asserts concept:prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009-sec-794a-ss-4-logic-deontic-2 .
